WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.599 --> 00:00:08.060
Speaker 1: We are going to be taking a deep
dove into false beliefs, delusion, misunderstanding,

00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:12.980
confusion and something that maybe we could
or should be calling tribal psychosis.

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:15.240
And that's where I want to start today.

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:21.180
You may have heard that there are attempts
to do what some are calling audit the election

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:22.240
in the state of Arizona.

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:25.580
Now, you might say audit the election.

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:27.030
Which election was there recently?

00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:29.590
An election in Arizona that I haven't heard
of?

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:30.590
No.

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:35.379
The answer is I'm talking about the November
of 2010 election now more than six months

00:00:35.379 --> 00:00:40.629
in the past, and there is a so-called audit
of the vote taking place.

00:00:40.629 --> 00:00:42.640
Now, I want to be 100 percent clear with you.

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:44.469
This is going absolutely nowhere.

00:00:44.469 --> 00:00:46.739
It's going it's going nowhere.

00:00:46.739 --> 00:00:52.101
The Republican controlled state Senate in
Arizona is undertaking a hand recount, an

00:00:52.101 --> 00:00:57.059
audit of the ballots and voting machines in
Maricopa County, which is the state's largest

00:00:57.059 --> 00:00:58.059
county.

00:00:58.059 --> 00:00:59.960
Biden won the county.

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:02.049
It was a Republican stronghold.

00:01:02.049 --> 00:01:04.659
Biden won that county by 45000 votes.

00:01:04.659 --> 00:01:11.510
The Senate in Arizona has taken possession
of over two million ballots and 400 election

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:19.000
machines and has turned them over to be audited
by companies that include one whose CEO is

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:22.970
a promoter of debunked election conspiracy
theories.

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:26.030
Understand who's doing this so-called audit.

00:01:26.030 --> 00:01:32.800
It's not even clear that the auditors are
compliant with the law about safeguarding

00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:33.800
ballots.

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:35.780
But forget about all of that for now.

00:01:35.780 --> 00:01:41.630
Here is an interview with a guy named John
Brakey, who's an official helping to run this

00:01:41.630 --> 00:01:42.630
audit.

00:01:42.630 --> 00:01:50.210
And he explains that auditors have a special
light with which they can check for Bambu

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:51.539
on the ballots.

00:01:51.539 --> 00:01:54.259
Now, why would you be looking for Bambu?

00:01:54.259 --> 00:01:58.799
Are you looking to make flooring or create
bamboo rope out of the ballots?

00:01:58.799 --> 00:02:04.850
No, they are looking for bamboo fibers because
there's lots of bamboo in Asia.

00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:06.859
I feel like an idiot even saying this.

00:02:06.859 --> 00:02:09.140
There's lots of bamboo in Asia.

00:02:09.140 --> 00:02:15.990
And these auditors believe that if you have
ballots with BAMN Trece bamboo fibers on them,

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:19.710
they could have been fraudulently smuggled
in from Asia.

00:02:19.710 --> 00:02:20.870
Take a look at this.

00:02:20.870 --> 00:02:23.890
Speaker 2: I'm sure the other day at the press
conference you were talking about bamboo.

00:02:23.890 --> 00:02:25.921
Speaker 3: What was that about?

00:02:25.921 --> 00:02:30.760
Well, it's that there's accusations of 40000
ballots were flown in to Arizona, into Arizona,

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:33.030
and it was stuffed into the box, OK?

00:02:33.030 --> 00:02:38.720
And it came from the southeast part of the
world, Asia, OK.

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:44.780
And and what they're doing is to find out
if there's bamboo in the paper, that camera

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:47.640
right there that they take a picture of the
ballot.

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:53.450
If you they can really look at depth and find
out, is it a hand mark paper ballot because

00:02:53.450 --> 00:02:56.230
it's a five camera.

00:02:56.230 --> 00:03:00.400
You can see the folds in the ballot because
92 percent of all the ballots here should

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:03.400
have been folded because they came in through
an envelope.

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:07.900
OK, so they're doing all sorts of testing
to prove if it was or wasn't.

00:03:07.900 --> 00:03:12.680
And that's very important because the only
way you could persuade people on changing

00:03:12.680 --> 00:03:14.270
is having facts.

00:03:14.270 --> 00:03:16.090
And we're on a mission for facts.

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:18.440
And I'm auditing Elections USA.

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:21.020
And what we do is not about the right or left.

00:03:21.020 --> 00:03:22.040
Audit is an acronym.

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:26.870
It stands for Americans United for Democracy,
Integrity and Transparency in elections.

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:29.340
We've been around for 17 years.

00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:31.510
We work all over the country for the last
five years.

00:03:31.510 --> 00:03:32.960
I'm litigation of Florida.

00:03:32.960 --> 00:03:35.200
I've sued in Alabama.

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:37.770
I negotiated in Virginia, I sued in Ohio.

00:03:37.770 --> 00:03:41.580
And I've been in 18 states just working elections.

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:46.540
And I all started because of the Bernie Sanders
election in 2016 with Hillary Clinton.

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:48.270
I'm the guy who sued the whole state.

00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:53.920
Speaker 1: It's genuinely difficult to know
what the most outrageous thing in the.

00:03:53.920 --> 00:04:01.530
Video is now, as usual, the conspiracy theory
makes no sense because no one Bambu on ballots

00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:06.430
wouldn't mean anything anyway, like bamboo
can grow in Arizona.

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:12.870
But also, if you wanted to try to steal the
election with so-called smuggled ballots of

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:18.130
or massive dumps of fake ballots, why would
you fly them in from Asia where they've got

00:04:18.130 --> 00:04:19.440
to go through customs?

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:21.630
Much more expensive to ship.

00:04:21.630 --> 00:04:24.180
You would just make the fake ballots in Arizona.

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:27.820
It doesn't make any there's no reason to go
to Asia for that.

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:30.850
And then, you know, bamboo fibers I'd be more
interested in.

00:04:30.850 --> 00:04:36.730
Look, I think barbecue sauce stains on the
ballots might be more meaningful than bamboo,

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:39.150
to be perfectly frank with you.

00:04:39.150 --> 00:04:42.990
Imagine being however old that guy is, 65,
70.

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:44.370
I don't know.

00:04:44.370 --> 00:04:52.700
And being so totally unable to discern reality
from fantasy in your life, if you went to

00:04:52.700 --> 00:04:58.610
many high schools, middle schools even, and
you presented this story to teenagers about

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:03.880
the bamboo fibers and all of this stuff, your
average teenager is going to question this.

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:07.700
And this is an adult who appears to have completely
fallen for all of it.

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:09.070
Is it a tribal psychosis?

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:10.070
Is it something else?

00:05:10.070 --> 00:05:11.070
I don't know.

00:05:11.070 --> 00:05:13.380
Super cameras to check for bamboo.

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:14.980
Just imagine what is going on here.

00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:17.760
It's like a it's like a turducken of wrong.

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:20.110
It's a duck inside, a chicken inside a turkey.

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:22.710
Or like the the Russian matryoshka dolls.

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:24.090
There's just another layer.

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:27.080
No matter how much you keep unpacking it,
it's a joke.

00:05:27.080 --> 00:05:33.500
And when the world sees guys like this searching
for bamboo with a special camera six months

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:37.500
after the election, we are a laughing stock
once again.

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:42.220
And the fact that this is going on makes me
question how we've even survived as a country

00:05:42.220 --> 00:05:43.710
for hundreds of years.

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:49.510
And believe you me, these auditors were hired
to find fraud.

00:05:49.510 --> 00:05:54.800
They will find something even if it's just
we found some inconclusive irregularities.

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:56.660
We need more ballots to review.

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:57.880
We need more study.

00:05:57.880 --> 00:05:59.389
We need to keep fighting this.

00:05:59.389 --> 00:06:01.639
They've been hired to find something.

00:06:01.639 --> 00:06:05.820
And whether they do or they don't, it will
